direction_608 = location "Crimson Wing" about "Crimson Wing\nCrimson Wings are ferovious Harpy monsters. With their savagery and scant intelligence, they indiscriminately level attacks at all organisms which enter its habitat. " found "El Morad Eslant" at 113 549 in zone 12

