    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I saw some Harpy type Monsters - Crimson Wings I think they're called - a few days ago while I was training. Big wings, Sharp claws... it's said that hundreds of people have died from their poisons in even little scratches. But, for you, they'd make for great training."

